WEBVTT

00:28:58.235 --> 00:29:00.976
"OK, let's just pause
that conversation for a second.

00:29:01.000 --> 00:29:06.256
Doctor, tell me what your intention was."

00:29:06.280 --> 00:29:09.771
And they'll say, "Well, I want
the patient to quit smoking."

00:29:09.795 --> 00:29:14.009
"Yes, tell me why you want
the patient to quit smoking."

00:29:14.033 --> 00:29:17.783
"Well, it's going to hurt
their lungs and ..."

00:29:17.807 --> 00:29:22.423
"OK, why do you care
whether it hurts their lungs?"

00:29:22.447 --> 00:29:25.162
"Well, they told me they don't
want to die of lung cancer

00:29:25.186 --> 00:29:26.363
like their mom did."

00:29:26.387 --> 00:29:28.123
"OK, yes, but why do you care?"

00:29:28.147 --> 00:29:30.003
"Well, because I care about them."